[31m-## How it works[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- `getTodayPlan()` in `curriculum365.js` computes `Math.floor((today - 2026-07-01) / 86400000)` and returns the matching row from `PLAN_365`. No state needed — pure date math.[m
[31m-- The "Mark Day Complete" button writes to `users/{uid}/missionEngine.completedDays[dayNum]`, which Firebase syncs.[m
[31m-- Each track card has its own local checkbox for within-session tracking of individual tracks — this isn't persisted (intentionally lightweight for v1).[m
[31m-- Year progress ring fills based on elapsed days since July 1 2026.[m
[31m-- DSA / GitHub counts persist to Firebase via `addDSA` / `addGithubCommits` (same as before).[m
